Package: tmux-tui
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, tmux, tmux-cli, ${misc:Depends}
Description: terminal UI for tmux sessions
 tmux-tui is a curses interface for tmux sessions. It talks to tmux through
 the tb command from tmux-cli.
 .
 This package installs the program under /usr/share/tmux-tui and links
 /usr/bin/tmux-tui to it.
